  "description": "Powerful 750W motor (peak 1300W+) with 90Nm torque and Shimano 7-Speed Gears for smooth, versatile riding. Factory set to Class 2 (20 mph), unlock speeds up to 32 mph with support for Class 1, 2, 3, and unlocked modes.\n\nEquipped with a 48V 20Ah removable lithium-ion battery, the AndSky e-bike delivers an impressive range of 50 to 70 miles per charge when using PAS level 1 in Class 2 mode, ensuring efficient performance, long-lasting power, and the convenience of easily removing the battery for charging or replacement.\n\nEnjoy precise and powerful braking with advanced hydraulic disc brakes. Designed for smooth, reliable stopping power, they provide control and safety in all conditions, ensuring confidence on every ride.\n\nThe adjustable handlebar, crafted from high-strength aluminum alloy, offers a -30° to +30° angle adjustment, allowing you to customize your riding posture for maximum comfort and control.\n\nSoft, supportive, and ergonomically designed for maximum comfort on every ride. Fits most adult bike seats and reduces pressure for long-distance cycling.\n\nEnjoy instant acceleration with the full twist throttle, giving you smooth, precise control over your e-bike’s speed. Effortless to use, ideal for quick starts, hill climbs, or passing traffic safely. Enhances your riding experience with convenience and power at your fingertips.\n\nEnjoy a fully adjustable front fork and rear suspension under the seat, delivering true full-suspension comfort for smoother rides. Combined with an adjustable handlebar, it ensures a perfectly customized and more comfortable riding experience on any terrain.\n\nTackle any surface with 26\"x4\" puncture-resistant fat tires, providing superior grip, stability, and comfort on all terrains—from sand to snow to rugged trails.\n\nRide safely day or night with an integrated lighting system that includes a powerful front headlight and rear light, both featuring built-in left and right turn signals for enhanced visibility and safer rides.",
